     {
      "w": 960,
      "h": 540,
      "src": "local:skolzero-side-guy"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "text",
    "html": "<big>We also wanted the product films to feel unapologetically like beer commercials. Beautiful golden liquids, ice-cold bottles and the kind of photography that makes you thirsty. After all, nobody should need a nutritional argument to crave a beer. ↴</big>",
    "align": "center"
